## What Good Looks Like
- Signals are routed to Hejo adjacent dependency, or out-of-scope.
- Customer and revenue evidence are separated from PM inference.
- Every recommendation is tagged to Horizon 1, Horizon 2, and one or more strategic pillars.
- The output makes the "so what" obvious for enterprise customers and Contentful.
- Team capacity is translated into company-level outcomes and prioritization language.
